  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RSSH - Pakistan (01-Jul-2016-30-Jun-2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pakistan, RSSH, Ministry of National Health Services, Regulations and Coordination of Pakistan (HPSIU)This program has the following goals: To ensure adequate timely provision of good quality ATM prevention and treatment services, particularly for the marginalized, through enhancement of governance, management and coordination of decision making and coordinating bodies of the health systems. The objectives of this program are: To develop an integrated approach to governance, management and coordination at the federal, provincial and district levels..  To enhance efficiency and effectiveness of the procurement supply chain management system through strengthening quality assurance of medical products and integration of the warehousing facilities..  To support the development of an integrated ATM Management Information System (MIS)</narrative>
  </description>
